{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965670/extras/eea8b5e987db9558d38f82e8873d26ce.avif?t=1767725040\" width=797 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965670/extras/8ed5f6609e25727e05dc33c075d9973b.avif?t=1767725040\" width=935 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cApollo Sonata\u201d is a 2D story-driven exploration ADV.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious urban legend has been spreading. Every night, strange incidents occur on campus\u2014blood flowing from toilets, blackboards covered in garbled writing, a path to the underworld appearing in the sky, and a piano playing by itself on the rooftop\u2026 It is said that these are all curses caused by vengeful spirits?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventurous high school girl Juniper organizes a courage-testing event and invites her two friends, Miu and MOMO, to join her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are these four famous urban legends real, or is there a hidden truth behind them? And wait\u2014more strange events happen during their adventure\u2026? Follow the girls\u2019 footsteps and uncover the truth yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965670/extras/364db3d470b5db7e6c45fbc84bc40d70.avif?t=1767725040\" width=1280 height=741 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965670/extras/463488f160049068ba1a37752c5d3f28.avif?t=1767725040\" width=935 height=196 /></span></p><p cla